Reported Issue
Description
 When a Service Point is created or updated using X1-ServicePoint IWS, the Service Point 
characteristics are getting updated only on the MDM (D1) side and are not being 
synchronized to the corresponding CCB (C1) Service Point. As a result, there is a data 
inconsistency of Service Point characteristics between the D1 (MDM) SP and C1 (CCB) SP 
char tables.
